        openings: ("{D} told a judge under oath that {D.his} adult child was working a restaurant shift on the night of a break-in. The restaurant's time clock shows the child clocked out at 6:02 p.m., and the manager says no shift ran late.", "{D} mixed up the weekends and spoke from memory, not from any wish to lie. An honest parent's mistake is not perjury."),
