        role: "Neighbor",
        exam: [.direct("Please describe your relationship with {D}.", "\"We are neighbors. We argued over a fence line, and it became tense. I did not want a conflict.\""), .direct("What did you hear on the voicemail on {DATE}?", "\"Move that truck off my line or I'll put you in the hospital. The voice was angry and clear.\""), .direct("How do you know it was the defendant?", "\"The phone records show the call came from {D}'s number. I also recognized the voice.\""), .direct("How did the message make you feel?", "\"Frightened. I did not know whether {D.he} meant it. I locked my doors and called deputies.\""), .direct("What did you do about the argument before?", "\"I sent a text. I wrote you'll regret parking there. I was upset about the truck, and I should not have written that.\""), .direct("What did you learn about the defendant's response?", "\"{DL} repeated the threat to another neighbor that evening. That made me more worried.\""), .cross("Did you send the defendant a text first?", "\"Yes. I wrote you'll regret parking there. I know it was a threat of a kind, and I should not have sent it.\""), .cross("Did the defendant say anything before the voicemail?", "\"We had argued earlier that day. I do not remember the exact words.\""), .cross("Did {D} ever hurt you?", "\"No. {D.He} never touched me. The voicemail was the first threat I received from {D.him}.\""), .cross("Was the voicemail in anger?", "\"Yes. The voice was angry. But {D.he} also said it was a joke afterward, and I cannot tell.\""), .cross("Did you call deputies right away?", "\"Yes. I did, after I heard the message. I also kept a copy of the voicemail.\"")],
        defenseRole: "Park ranger",
        defenseExam: [.direct("What are your duties as a park ranger?", "\"I patrol a park near the neighborhood. I know many people in the area, and I have watched this dispute for a while.\""), .direct("What did you see about the fence line?", "\"Both neighbors argued over it. It got tense, and both sides said things in anger.\""), .direct("What do you know about {V}'s text?", "\"I saw the text. It said you'll regret parking there. It is a threat, and {D} reacted to it.\""), .direct("How would you describe {D}?", "\"Quick to anger but never violent. {DF} has never raised a hand to anyone, and I was surprised by the case.\""), .direct("What did you hear the defendant say about the voicemail?", "\"{DF} said it was a joke after {V} threatened {DF} first. {DF} was upset and ashamed afterward.\""), .direct("What would you say about the dispute?", "\"It was petty. It should have been settled with a survey. Both sides escalated, and it got out of hand.\""), .cross("Did you hear the voicemail?", "\"No. I only heard about it. I do not know the exact words.\""), .cross("Did {V} threaten the defendant?", "\"The text says you'll regret parking there. That is a threat of a kind, but less direct.\""), .cross("Did the defendant repeat the threat to another neighbor?", "\"I heard that. I do not know who the neighbor was.\""), .cross("Did you see the defendant act violently?", "\"No. Never. I have never seen {DF} hit anyone.\""), .cross("You were not present when {D} made the call, were you?", "\"No. I only know what {D.he} told me about it afterward. I cannot tell you what was said or in what tone.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} threatened a neighbor with violence.", "A joke in reply to an earlier threat."),
