        openings: ("On {DATE}, {V} played a voicemail that said, Move that truck off my line or I'll put you in the hospital. The number belonged to {D}, who had argued with {V} over a fence line, and {D} repeated the threat to another neighbor that evening.", "The defense will present a text from {V} that said you'll regret parking there, a reply made in anger, and a person who never meant it. A heated exchange between neighbors is not always a crime."),
