        defenseRole: "Server coworker",
        defenseExam: [.direct("What does your work as a server coworker involve?", "\"I work at the restaurant as a server. I know {D} well, and I have worked beside {D.him} for years.\""), .direct("What did the manager say about the backup reader?", "\"The manager told us to use it when the terminal was slow. I used it too.\""), .direct("How did {D} handle cards?", "\"Carefully. {D.He} followed the instructions and never kept a card. I never saw {D.him} do anything suspicious.\""), .direct("What kind of person is the defendant?", "\"Honest and friendly. {D.He} is always on time and does not take shortcuts. I was surprised by the charges.\""), .direct("Who else had access to the reader?", "\"Several servers and the manager. It was kept in the office, and anyone could take it.\""), .direct("What did you think when you heard about the fraud?", "\"I was shocked. I worried about our regulars. I told the manager what I knew.\""), .cross("Did you see the defendant copy a card?", "\"No. I did not. I only know that we used the reader as told.\""), .cross("Did the defendant take the reader home?", "\"I do not know. I did not see that. I only know it was in the office.\""), .cross("Did the defendant buy a console?", "\"I heard so. I do not know how it was paid for.\""), .cross("Did you use the reader on cards?", "\"Yes. I did, as told. I did not know it could copy data.\""), .cross("Did the manager tell you to use it?", "\"Yes. The manager said to use it when the terminal was slow.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} copied diners' cards.", "A reader that belonged to the manager."),
