        defendant: [.direct("What can you tell us about your relationship with {V}?", "\"{V} was my parent. I took care of {V} for the last two years and managed the farm.\""), .direct("Did you forge the deed?", "\"No. I never signed anything for my parent. I filed a deed that I believed {V} had signed.\""), .direct("Who signed the deed, and where?", "\"My parent, in the hospital. A nurse brought {V.him} a pen, and {V.he} signed what I'd typed up with a lawyer's form.\""), .direct("Why did you file it three weeks before {V.he} died?", "\"{V.He} asked me to. {V.He} didn't want the farm to go to probate or be split up.\""), .direct("Where was the notary?", "\"I didn't know the notary wasn't there. I got the form from a friend who said it had been notarized.\""), .direct("What did you do when the family challenged the deed?", "\"I told them it was what my parent wanted. I didn't think anyone would challenge it.\""), .cross("The notary was out of state on the date of the stamp. How is that possible?", "\"I don't know. I assumed the stamp was valid, and I didn't check.\""), .cross("A handwriting examiner says the signature isn't your parent's. Is the examiner wrong?", "\"I wasn't in the room when {V.he} signed, so I can't say. {V.He} was very sick, and {V.his} handwriting had changed.\""), .cross("You searched online about notarizing a deed. Why?", "\"I wanted to make sure it was done right. I didn't know the rules.\""), .cross("You benefitted from the deed. Isn't that a motive?", "\"I did, but I took care of {V.him} and the farm for two years. {V.He} wanted me to have it.\""), .cross("Why not wait until {V.he} had recovered?", "\"{V.He} wasn't going to recover. The doctors said weeks.\"")],
